DARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1805,"row":{"en":"Earhart was an American aviator who became the first woman to fly solo across the Atlantic Ocean.","wo":"Earhart benn aviateur américain la woon, mooy jigéen ji njëkka jéggal géeju Atlantik ci avion te àndul ak kenn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nEarhart ben aviateur américain la wone, moy djiguéne dji ndieuka djégal guédjou atlantique ci avion té andoul ak kene.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1806,"row":{"en":"My friend Joseph called me to talk about it.","wo":"Sama xarit Joseph wooma di ci waxtaan ak man.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSama kharit Joseph wo ma di thi wakhtane ak mane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1807,"row":{"en":"Thank you for coming, she said. I love you.","wo":"Nima, Sant naala ci linga fi ñëw, bëgg naala.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNima sant nala thi linga fi nieuw beug nala\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1808,"row":{"en":"The main character, Constance, is a young woman who is struggling to come to terms with the recent death of her husband.","wo":"Personaas bu mag baa gi tuddu Constance, xale bu jigéen la buy xeex ngir génn ci jafe-jafe yi mu nekk ginaaw bi jëkëram génnee àdduna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPersonaas bou mag ba gui toudou constance khalé bou djiguéne la bouy khekh nguir guéne si diafé diafé yi mou nekk guinaw bi dieukeureum guéné addouna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1809,"row":{"en":"But be careful not to overdo it. You don't want to get too full or too tipsy!","wo":"Waaye nak nga moytu cee xër. Damay bañ nga lekk wala naan ba doo mënati taxaw!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé nak nga moytou thié heurr! Damay bagn nga lekk wala nane ba do meunati takhaw!\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1810,"row":{"en":"Dr. Carter enjoys playing basketball, street hockey, flag football, golf and running.","wo":"Dr. Carter dafa bëgg jouer basketball, street hokey, flag football, golf ak daw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDr carter dafa beug jouer basketball, street hokey, flag football, golf ak dawé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1811,"row":{"en":"As he was walking back to his office, Vimes passed a small stationery shop.","wo":"Bi Vimes di dox di dellu barabu liggéeyukaayam, mu romb benn butig ci yoon wi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi vimes di dokh di dellou barabou ligueyoukayam mou romb bene boutiq thi yone wi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1812,"row":{"en":"The largest human influence on climate change has been the emission of greenhouse gases such as carbon dioxide, methane and nitrous oxide.","wo":"Li nit ñi liggéey lu gëna waral coppite klimaa bi mooy bi ñu amee gaz yu ñuy bàyyi ñu dem ci jawwu ji, lu ci melni gaz carbonique, methane ak oxide nitreux.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi nitt gni liguey lou geuna waral coppité climaa bi moy bi gnou amé gaz you gnuy bayi gnou dem thi djaw dji, lou thi melni gaz carbonique, methane ak oxide nitreux.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1813,"row":{"en":"One day, a young girl named Lily was playing near the river when she saw a turtle caught in a fishing net.","wo":"Benn bis mu am xale bu jigéen bu tuddu Lily bu doon fo ci wetu dex gi, mu daal di gis mbonaat bu benn mbaal jàpp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn biss mou ame khalé bou djiguéne bou toudou Lily bou done foo thi wetou deukh gui, mou dale di guiss mbonate bou benn mbal diap.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1814,"row":{"en":"To predict the nationality of the player who won the contest.","wo":"Jéema xam nasionaalite joueur ci jël raw gàddu gi ci joŋante bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjééma kham nationalité joueur bi si dieul raw gadou gui si dioganté bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1815,"row":{"en":"The waiter replies, Well, sir, you did order a filet mignon.","wo":"Kiñ séddale niko, waa xanaa du yaa laaj filet mignon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKign sedalé niko wa khanaa dou ya ladj filet mignon.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1816,"row":{"en":"As the sun began to set, the festival came to a close.","wo":"Bi jant tàmbalee so, festival bi daal di tëj.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi diant tambalé so, festival bi daldi teudj.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1817,"row":{"en":"The man and woman board the train.] Man: This is the best seat in the house.","wo":"Ku góor ki ak ku jigéen ki ànd dugg ci biir saxaar gi.] Ku góor ki: Bii mooy toogukaay bu gëna neex ci kër gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou goor ki ak kou djiguéne ki ande dougg thi biir sakhaar gui. Kou goor ki: Bii moy toogoukay bou geuna nekh si keur gui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1818,"row":{"en":"She had come to the city with big dreams, but she quickly found that reality was much different than she had imagined.","wo":"Bi muy ñëw ci dëkk bi, yaakaar gu rëy la àndaloon, waaye bimu demee tuuti mu gis ni limu yaakaar wuutena ak li am.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi mouy nieuw si deuk bi yakar gou reuy la andalon wayé bimou démé touti mou guiss ni limou yakar wouténa ak li am.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1819,"row":{"en":"They can wash away dirt and debris, making roads and sidewalks impassable.","wo":"Mën nañu raxas tilim ak dindi mbalit, mën nañu tax ba kenn du mëna jaar ci yoon yi ak trotoire yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nagnou rakhass tilim ak dindi mbalite, meun nagnou takh ba kene dou meuna diar thi yone yi ak trotoire yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1820,"row":{"en":"With proper treatment, you can get relief from your symptoms and prevent further complications.","wo":"Soo ci teelee jog nga faj ko, amaana feebar bi du yegg fu ëppi loxo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo thi téllé diog nga fadj ko, amana fébar bi dou yeugg fou eupé lokho.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1821,"row":{"en":"In addition to being a great comedy, She's the Man is also a film with a strong message about gender equality.","wo":"Ginaaw limu nekk filmu komedi She's the Man film la itam buy waxaale ni góor baax na jigéen baax na.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGinaaw limou nekk filmou komedi She's the Man film la itame bouy wakhalé ni goor bakh na djiguéne bakh na.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1822,"row":{"en":"Confirm your decision to attend through your admissions application.","wo":"Firndelal sa yeene ngir jaare ci say demànd ngir teewe ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFirndelal sa yéné nguir diar thi say demandes nguir téwé ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1823,"row":{"en":"Close your eyes and take a deep breath.","wo":"Tëjal say bët nga noyyi bu baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTeudjeul say beut nga noyi bou bakh\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1824,"row":{"en":"The workday typically starts around 8am and ends around 5pm, with a lunch break in the middle of the day.","wo":"Nit ñi 8 waxtu ci suba lañuy tàmbali liggéey, wàcci 5 waxtu ci ngoon, ci diggu bëccëg gi ñu dem añ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNit gni 8 wahtou thi souba laniou tambali liguey, wathi 5 wahtou thi ngone, thi digue beuthieuk gui gnou dem agne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1825,"row":{"en":"Don't just sit around and cry about it.","wo":"Ngeen bàyyi toog di jooy.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNgeen bayi togue di dioyé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1826,"row":{"en":"The British-controlled region became known as Southern Cameroons, while the French-controlled region became known as French Cameroon.","wo":"Diwaan bi Britannique yi yor ñu tudde ko Sud Cameroun, diwaan bi français yi yor ñu tudde ko Cameroun Français.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDiwane bi britannique yi yor gnou toudé ko sud cameroun, diwane bi francais yi yor gnou toudé ko cameroun francais.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1827,"row":{"en":"The height at which an aircraft could fly was also a critical factor, as it determined how far it could travel and how much weight it could carry.","wo":"Kawewaay bi roppalaan bi mëna kawe ci jawwu ji lu am solo la, ndax dafay wane ndax dina mëna dem fu sori am déet ak ban diisaay la àttan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKawéway bi roppalaan bi meuna kawé thi diaw dji lou am solo la ndakh dafay wané ndakh dina meuna dem fou sori am déet ak ban diisay la attane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1828,"row":{"en":"Ambedkar Jayanti is a day of celebration in India and other countries around the world to honor the memory of Dr. Bhimrao Ramji Ambedkar, a social reformer, jurist, and political leader who was a key figure in the Indian independence movement and the architect of the Constitution of India.","wo":"Ambedkar Jayanti bis bu ñuy màggal la ci réewum Inde ak ci yeneen réew ci àdduna bi ngir sargal Dr. Bhimrao Ramji Ambedkar, di ku liggéey lu bari ci jàppale askan, jurist, teg nekkoon njiit ci wàllu politik, bokkoon ci ñi jiitewoon bi Inde bëggee moom boppam, ak ñi bind Sàrti ndayi réewu Inde.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmbedkar Jayanti biss bou gnuy magal la thi réewoum Inde ak thi yenen réew thi addouna bi nguir sargal Dr Bhimrao Ramji Ambedkar di kou liguey lou bari thi diapalé askane juriste te nekone njiite thi wallou politique bokone thi gni djitéwone bi Inde beugué mom boppame ak gni bind Sàrti ndayi rééwou Inde.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1829,"row":{"en":"Nah, they'll get it, said Tom. Trust me.","wo":"Tom niko, déedet dina ñu xam, maala ko wax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTom niko dédéte dina gnou kham mala ko wakh\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1830,"row":{"en":"The Shire River is a major tributary of the Zambezi River and is an important source of water for irrigation and transportation.","wo":"Dexu Shire moo gëna mag ci ndox yi bawoo Dexu Zambezi ba noppi nekk lu am solo ci irigaasioŋ ak dem ak dikk ci ndox.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDeukhou Shire mo gueuna mague si ndokh yi bawoo Deukhou Zambezi ba noppi neuk lou ame solo si irrigation ak dem ak dik si ndokh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1831,"row":{"en":"I was a little bit confused at first, but Ms. Smith explained everything clearly.","wo":"Xawoon naa réer bi Madam Smith di tàmbali, waaye mu leeral lépp bamu leer.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhawone naa rér bi madame smith di tambali wayé mou léral lép bamou leer.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1832,"row":{"en":"I reach for the postcard on the nightstand and write my name and address on the front.","wo":"Ma jël kàrt postaal bi ci taabal ju ndaw ji, daal di bind sama tur ci kanam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa dieul kart postal bi si table djou ndaw dji daldi bind sama tour si kanam\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1833,"row":{"en":"It can give us hope, strength, and peace.","wo":"Mën nanu jox yaakaar, doole ak jàmm.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nagnou diokh yakar dolé ak diam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1834,"row":{"en":"It is a terror that lurks in the shadows, waiting to pounce at the most unexpected moment.","wo":"Tiitaange la gu làqu ci lëndëm gi, xaar fumu naan jameet fuñu ko xaarul woon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTiitangé la gu lakhou si leundeum gui, khar foumou nane diaméte fougnou ko kharoul wone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1835,"row":{"en":"It’s gorgeous, crazy, insane, and I could listen to it on repeat forever.","wo":"Neex na lool, yéeme na, jéggina dayo, mën naa ko déglu ba sonn duma doyal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNekhna lool yéména djéguina dayo meun nako déglou ba sone douma doyal\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1836,"row":{"en":"There were vendors selling everything from simple padlocks to complex combination locks, and artisans demonstrating their skills in lockpicking and locksmithing.","wo":"Amoon na jaaykat yuy jaay lu nekk dalee ko ci gombu bu yomb ba ci loke yiy am kod booy dugal, am ñenn ñu xarañ ñuy wane seen manin ci defar seriir ak loke.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmoon na djaykat youy djay lou nek dalé ko thi gombou bou yomb ba thi loké yiy ame code booy dougal, ame gnén gnou kharagn gnouy wané seen manine ci defar seriir ak loké.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1837,"row":{"en":"At one point, the widow stood up and raised her glass.","wo":"Amna fu soxna si nara ténji taxaw yëkkati kaasam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmna fou sokhna si nara tendji takhaw yeukati kassam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1838,"row":{"en":"Perfect for the cold, wet spring and winter, this coat will keep your dog warm, dry, and especially clean!","wo":"Vest bii baaxna lool ci seen xaj, muy taw ci pringtemps wala hiver, du tooy ba noppi dafay set!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nVest bi bakhna lol si sen khadj, mouy taw si printemps wala hiver, dou toy ba noppi dafay sete !\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1839,"row":{"en":"The dog looks so ridiculous that it's impossible not to laugh.","wo":"Kenn xamul lu xaj bi di nuru, soo koy xool di ree.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKen khamoul lou khadj bi di nourou, soo koy khol di ré.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1840,"row":{"en":"I'm so glad you're here, she said. I'm glad I'm here too, I said.","wo":"Muni ma, kontaan naa ci li nga fi nekk? Ma tontu ko, maala gëna kontaan ci nekk fi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMouni ma contane naa si li nga fi nekk? Ma tontou ko mala geuna contane si nekk fi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1841,"row":{"en":"But the old woman's eyes were bright and her face was filled with joy, and Henry couldn't help but be drawn in.","wo":"Waaye bëti ku jigéen ki dañu yànj kanamam fees dell ak bànneex, te Henry mënu ci woon baña lab.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé beuti kou djiguéne ki dagnou yandj kanamam fess dell ak baneh té henry meuneu thi wone bagna lab.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1842,"row":{"en":"The other day, I saw him walking down the hall, and he was literally shaking.","wo":"Keroog dama ko fekk muy dox ci hall bi muy lox bu baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKéroog damako fekk mouy dokh si hall bi mouy lokh bou bakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1843,"row":{"en":"Beauty became her mystery, companion, guide, and inspiration.","wo":"Taar moo nekkoon liko jaaxal, àndandoom, wasilaam ak royuwaayam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTaar mo nekone liko diahal andandom wassilam ak royouwayam\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1844,"row":{"en":"Over time, we learned names, stories, systems, and networks.","wo":"Jamono di dox ñuy jàng ay tur, ay jaar-jaar, ay sistem ak reso.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDiamono di dokh gnuy diang ay tour, ay jaar jaar, ay system ak réseau.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1845,"row":{"en":"Anyone who is a first-time parent knows the challenges of figuring out what to buy.","wo":"Képp kuy sooga am doom ju njëkk di nga am jafe-jafe xam loo wara jënd.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKeup kouy soga ame dome djou ndieuk di nga ame diafé diafé kham loo wara dieundé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1846,"row":{"en":"They accomplished their goals and created a legacy of self-determination to which others may aspire.","wo":"Matal nañu seen mébet ba noppi bàyyi fa ndono gëm sa bopp gu ñeneen ñi mën a roy.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMatal nagnou seen meubeut ba