ything.","wo":"Mu xawa janaxe, daal di xalaat lu mu wara def, waaye mënul baña def dara.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou khawa dianakhe daldi khalat loumou wara def wayé meunoul bagnia def dara\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1855,"row":{"en":"Floods are a natural disaster that can cause widespread damage and loss of life.","wo":"Mbënd jéeya ju mag la, mën na yàq lu bari te itam ay nit mën nañu ci ñàkk seen bakan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMbend dieya djou mag la meun na yakhe lou bari té itam ay nitt meun nagnou thi niak seen bakane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1856,"row":{"en":"The members of the Fish and Wildlife Service are divided on whether or not to add the rainbow mouth fish to the list of protected species.","wo":"Ndawi Serwiisu Jën ak Rabu àll yi bokku maase ci xalaat ndax dañuy boole jënu gémmiñu xon ci limu mbindéef yiñ wara aar am déet.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdawi serwiissou dieun ak rabou all yi bokou massé thi khalaat ndakh daniouy boolé dieuneu guémmignou khon thi limou mbindéff yign wara aar ame détt.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1857,"row":{"en":"The smoke from the wood fire slowly permeated the vegetables, giving them a delicious flavor.","wo":"Saxaar si bawoo ci matt mi di dugg ndànk di lujum yi, daal di leen jox cafka gu neex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSaharr si bawoo thi matt mi di dougg ndank di loudioum yi, daldi lén diokh cafka gou nékh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1858,"row":{"en":"Organ trafficking is often carried out by organized crime groups.","wo":"Ay kuréeli defkati ñaawtéef ñooy faral ci jaay cëri nit ñi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAy koureeli defkati niawteef gnoy faral thi diay thieri nitt gni.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1859,"row":{"en":"I will, I said.","wo":"Mani ko, Dinaa ci bàyyi xel.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMani ko dina thi bayi khél.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1860,"row":{"en":"Volunteer somewhere: a soup kitchen, a clothing closet, a homeless shelter.","wo":"Wutal fooy dimbalee nit ñi: saraxe ñam, maye yéere, fat ku amul fumu fanaan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWoutal fo dimbalé nitt gni: sarakhé gniam, mayé yéré, fate kou amoul foumou fanaané.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1861,"row":{"en":"Careful snow evaluation, cautious route-finding, and conservative decision-making are essential.","wo":"Dafay am solo lool ñu jàngat neige bi bu baax, xool yoon yi wóora jaar ak jël matuwaay ak dogal yi gën.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafay am solo lol gnou diangat neige bi bou bakh khol yone yi wora diar ak dieul matouway ak dogal yi gueun.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1862,"row":{"en":"The wrong tenants may cause major damage and cut back the worth of the property.","wo":"Luwekat yu bonn yi mënnañu yaxx lu bëri wala waññi xëyma wu ab moomel.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLouwekat you bone yi meunagnou yakh lou beuri walla wagnii kheuyma wou ab momel.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1863,"row":{"en":"The portfolio was heavy, and the line was long.","wo":"Portfëy bi diisoon na, te rang bi guddoon na.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPortefeuille bi dissona té rang bi goudona.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1864,"row":{"en":"Steam trains are beautiful.","wo":"Saxaaru vapër yi dañu rafet.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSakharou vapeur yi daniou rafet.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1865,"row":{"en":"You’re a new person now.","wo":"Leegi beneen nit nga.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLegui beneen nitt nga dé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1866,"row":{"en":"Salesperson: We have a few options that might work. This one is made from wool and has a simple geometric pattern.","wo":"Jaaykat bi: Am nanu fi yenn yu lay wara neex. Bii leen lañu ko defaree ba noppi am motif geometrik yu xumbul.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDiaykat bi: Am nagnou fi yenn youlay wara nekhé. Bii léne lagnouko défaré ba noppi am motif géometrik you khoumboul.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1867,"row":{"en":"There are a lot of factors that can affect my blood sugar, including what I eat, how much I exercise, and how much stress I am under.","wo":"Barina mbir yu mëna indi jafe-jafe ci sa suukëru deret, mën na nekk li ngay lekk, ni ngay tàggatee sa yaram, ak stress bu bari bi ngay dundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBarina mbir you meuna indi diafé diafé si sa soukeurou deret, meun na neuk li ngay lekk, ni ngay taggaté sa yaram, ak stress bou bari bi ngay doundou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1868,"row":{"en":"Our mission: to organize the world's information and make it universally accessible and useful.","wo":"Suñu yitté mooy : defar xibaari àddina ak fexe ba ku nekk mën ci jot te mu am njëriñ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSougnou yitté moy: defar khibaari addina ak fexé ba kou nek meun thi diot té mou ame ndieurigne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1869,"row":{"en":"Ram looked at me in surprise What do you mean? he asked My sculptures are a celebration of life.","wo":"Ram xool ma jaaxle nima, Loo bëgga wax foofu? Samay yatteef dañuy màggal dundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRame khol ma diaxle nima, loo beuga wakh fofou? Samay yatef daniouy magal doundou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1870,"row":{"en":"It’s a symbol of your past, and it’s time to move on.","wo":"Dafa wara nekk sa ginaaw, waroo ci dellusi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa wara nek sa guinaw waro thi delloussi\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1871,"row":{"en":"The rash was itchy and unsightly, but it didn't cause me any other problems.","wo":"Tëndandiir yi dañu doon xasan ba noppi rafetu ñu woon ci gis, waaye indi wuñu beneen jafe-jafe.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTeundandiir yi daniou done khassane ba noppi rafetou gnou wone si guiss wayé indi wouniou beneen diafé diafé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1872,"row":{"en":"The woman was eventually found on Thursday, about 10 miles from where she had been hiking.","wo":"Alxamis lañu gis ndaw si, rombu 10 mile fimu nekkoo di yéeg tundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAlkhamiss lagnou guiss ndaw si rombou 10 miles fimmou nekkoo di yégue toundou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1873,"row":{"en":"He also helped with a car wash to raise money for a classmate involved in a car crash.","wo":"Jàppale nañu itam ci raxasum auto ngir am xaalis bu ñuy jàppale sunu xarit bu loru ci accident auto.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDiappalé nagnou itame si rakhassoum auto nguir ame khalis bou niouy diappalé souniou kharite bou lorou si accident auto.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1874,"row":{"en":"You don't want to interrupt the fairy king and queen sacred moon dancing ritual.","wo":"Bëgguloo dakkal peccum aada bu buur bi ak soxnam di faral di def ci leerayu weer wi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBeugoulô dakal peuthieum aada bou boure bi ak sokhnam di faral di def thi leerayou weer wi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1875,"row":{"en":"process","wo":"doxalin yu xel nàngu","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\ndokhaline you hel nangou\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1876,"row":{"en":"Water is essential for life.","wo":"Ndox mënul ñàkk ci dundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdokh meunoul gnak si doundou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1877,"row":{"en":"Mum, what’s wrong? She takes a deep breath and turns to face me.","wo":"Yaay, lu xew? Mu noyyi bu baax ba noppi wëlbatiku jàkkarloo ak man.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYaye lou heuw? Mou noyi bou bakh ba nopi weulbatikou diakarlou ak mane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1878,"row":{"en":"He was a member of the Indian National Congress, but he eventually broke away from the party and formed his own political organization, the Scheduled Castes Federation.","wo":"Bokkoon na ci Congre Nasionaal bu Inde, waaye dafa mujje génn ci pàrti boobu ba noppi nas kuréelu politigu boppam tuddee ko Boole Xeet yépp ñuy Benn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBokone na thie Congre Nasionaal bou Inde wayé dafa moudié guéne thie parti bobou ba nopi nass kourélou politigue boppam toudé ko Boolé Khéte yeup niouy Bene.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1879,"row":{"en":"He can't treat his employees like that and expect them to stay.","wo":"Mënul toraxal liggéeykat bu baax ba noppi yaakaar mu toog.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeunoul torokhal ligueykat bou bakh ba nopi yakar mou tog.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1880,"row":{"en":"So next time you're outside at night, take a moment to appreciate the darkness.","wo":"Kon beneen yoon soo génnee guddi, nanga toog ab diir nga dundu neexaayu lëndëm.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKon beneen yone soo guéné goudi nanga togue ab diir nga doundou nékhayou leundeum.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1881,"row":{"en":"Thank you for your patience while we investigate shipment","wo":"Jërëjëf ci sab taaxirlu ci jamono ji ñuy gëstoo yónnee gi","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDieureudieuf ci sa takhir lou ci diamono dji gnuy guestou yonee gui\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1882,"row":{"en":"Fatima Messaoudi: I've overcome these challenges by working hard and never giving up.","wo":"Fatima Messaoudi: Ni may def ba génn ci mooy damay gëna liggéey ba noppi baña xàddi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFatima Messaoudi: Ni may def ba guenn si moy damay geuna liguey ba noppi bagna khaddi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1883,"row":{"en":"In some cases, these events can cause entire crop yields to be lost, leading to food shortages and price increases.","wo":"Amna numuy deme baykat yi ñàkk liñu waroon góob lépp, te loolu mën na jur xiif, wala njëg yu gëna yokk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmna nimouy démé baykat yi gnakk lignou warone goob lép té lolou meun na diour khiif wala ndieug you geuna yokk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1884,"row":{"en":"Raman and Buddy shared many happy years together.","wo":"Raman ak Buddy bokk nañu dundu at yu neex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRaman ak Buddy bokk nagnou doundou at you nekh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1885,"row":{"en":"Click the button to donate online using paypal, debit or credit card;","wo":"Bësal ngir jàppale ci sa xaalis ci paypal, kàrt kredi wala fayukaay;","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBeusal nguir diappalé si sa khalis si paypal, kart kredi wala fayoukay;\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1886,"row":{"en":"Haitians fought and won the only ever successful national slave revolution in history.","wo":"Waa Haiti ñooy wenn askin ci àdduna wu musa xeex ngir dox buumu ba noppi jële ca ndam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWaa haiti gnoy wenn askan thi addouna wou meussa khekh nguir dokh boumou ba noppi dieulé thia ndam\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1887,"row":{"en":"He was tired, he was frustrated, and he just wanted to go home and sleep for a week.","wo":"Mu sonn, xolam jeex, bëggatul woon ludul ñibbi dem nelaw benn ayu-bis.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou sonn kholam diékh beugatul wone loudoul gnibi dem nelaw bene ayou biss\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1888,"row":{"en":"They provide care for a variety of illnesses and injuries, and they play a vital role in the prevention, diagnosis, and treatment of disease.","wo":"Dañuy fay xeetu feebar ak gaañ-gaañu yu bari, te dañuy def liggéey bu am solo ci wàllu fàggu, saytu ak