},{"row_idx":1894,"row":{"en":"Oh, yeah? Well, I'm a better writer than you are!","wo":"Ah han? Waa man maala dàqa bind!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAh han wa mane mala daga bindé !\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1895,"row":{"en":"It was a simple toy, but it was also very well-made.","wo":"Fowukaay bu yomb la, waaye defar bu baax lañu ko defar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFowoukay bou yombe la wayé defar bou bakh lagnou ko defar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1896,"row":{"en":"He tried to talk to her about it, but she just shrugged him off.","wo":"Mu jéem ci wax ak moom, waaye mu yëngal ak mbaggam daal di dem.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou djéme thi wakh ak mom wayé mou yeungal ak mbagam daldi dem\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1897,"row":{"en":"The laws of kosher are based on the Torah, the first five books of the Hebrew Bible.","wo":"Yooni kosher dañu tënku ci Torah, juróomi téere yi njëkk ci Bible Hebreu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYooni koshere daniou teunkou si Torah diouromi tééré yi dieuk si Bible Hebreu.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1898,"row":{"en":"We had a small school, a general store, and a post office.","wo":"Dëkk bi amoon na daara ju ndaw, bitig buy jaay lépp, ak buro post.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDeuk bi amone na daara djou ndaw, bitik bouy diay leup, ak bureau poste.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1899,"row":{"en":"It was nothing to jump on a plane for an international adventure or a spontaneous weekend trip to a bucket-list city.","wo":"Aajoowuton nitt di ci yeeg roplan ngir ab tukki internasional wala ab tukki bu gaaw ci ab mujjentalu aybës ci ab dëkk taax buñu don bëgga dem.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAjoowoutone nitt di ci yég roplan nguir ab touki international wala ab touki bou gaaw si ab mujjentalou aybeuss si ab deukk taakh bouniou done beug dem.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncate